⭐ STAR Story 1 – Leadership & Stakeholder Alignment
Situation: Transitioned into Program Manager role for CMO platform, where multiple teams had conflicting priorities.
Task: Align backlog priorities across engineering, product, and business stakeholders.
Action:Facilitated workshops to capture requirements.Created a transparent roadmap in Jira.Balanced technical debt vs. business features.
Result: Achieved 100% stakeholder buy-in, reduced backlog churn by 30%, and improved sprint predictability.

⭐ STAR Story 2 – Technical Challenge & Problem-Solving
Situation: Kubernetes clusters faced scaling issues during peak workloads.
Task: Ensure resilience and scalability of orchestration layer.
Action:Introduced auto-scaling policies.Implemented Prometheus + Grafana observability stack.Coordinated rollout with DevOps CI/CD pipelines.
Result: Reduced downtime by 60%, improved cluster provisioning speed by 40%, and increased adoption across 3 business units.

⭐ STAR Story 3 – Driving Innovation
Situation: Customers struggled with resource sizing for workloads.
Task: Improve usability and intelligence of orchestration platform.
Action:Proposed AI-driven recommendations using RAG + LangChain.Partnered with engineering to prototype contextual resource allocation.Ran pilot with internal teams.
Result: Delivered 20% cost savings and improved customer satisfaction scores due to smarter resource allocation.

⭐ STAR Story 4 – Handling Ambiguity
Situation: Requirements for a new compliance feature were unclear.
